  "prefLabel": "Ins 103.02 Department Response",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ins 103.02 Department Response.\n\n(a) The department shall respond to all requests for records as soon as practicable and in accordance with RSA 91-A.\n\n(b) When inspection of publicly available records is not immediately feasible, the requesting party and the department shall agree upon a mutually convenient time for such.\n\n(c) By agreement between the requesting party and the department, copies shall be electronically sent to a valid email address provided by the requesting party.\n\n(d) If copies are requested, the requesting party shall be charged a fee for the actual cost of the paper or electronic copies as assessed by the department.\n\nSource. #6967, eff 3-26-9999; ss by #7984, eff 11-10-03; ss by #12983, eff 2-1-20 (formerly Ins 103.03)\n\nAPPENDIX",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/ins100.html"
